### Get all blogs
GET http://localhost:3003/api/blogs

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3003/api/users

### Add new user
POST http://localhost:3003/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Testaaja",
  "name": "Testi Käyttäjä",
  "password": "Testisana1234"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3003/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Testaaja",
  "password": "Testisana1234"
}

### Add blog with token
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_TÄHÄN

{
  "title": "TESTI toimii!",
  "author": "KirsikkAAA",
  "url": "http://example.com",
  "likes": 1
}

### Add blog without token (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tämähän toimii",
  "author": "Kirsikka",
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "likes": 1
}

### Add blog with token
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_TÄHÄN

{
  "title": "AAAAA toimii!",
  "author": "KirsikkAAA",
  "url": "http://example.com",
  "likes": 1
}

### Delete blog (correct user)
DELETE http://localhost:3003/api/blogs/**ID_TÄHÄN**
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_TÄHÄN

### Delete blog without token
DELETE http://localhost:3003/api/blogs/**ID_TÄHÄN**